**Steward:** Autonomicity Games Inc.
**Canonical contact:** info@Rathor.ai

### Changes from v1.1

- Free individual use is limited to personal use/play, education and research, and non-commercial creative work.
- The v1.1 “modest personal income” / independent-creative income carve-out is removed.
- Any revenue or income from using the Software requires a paid commercial licence (see §1A and §2).
- Transition rules for copies obtained under v1.1 are stated in §7 (council ruling).
- Clarification (2026-11-14): §1B states that third-party components, models, model code and their outputs are not part of the Work. This clarification does not change the AG-SML v1.2 effective date or the §7 transition dates.

AG-SML is the house license of Autonomicity Games. It is a
source-available grant for natural persons. Public visibility of this
repository does **not** make the Work open source (not OSI), does **not**
make MIT the parent license, and does **not** grant a corporate, product,
hosted-for-profit, or sublicense-for-sale right.

This file is the controlling public grant for this repository.
