## 4. Contributions

A patch sent to this repository is offered under AG-SML v1.2 and may be
accepted into the stewarded Work. The contributor keeps copyright in their
patch; the steward may sublicense accepted patches under AG-SML and under a
paid commercial license. Do not send patches you cannot offer on those terms.

## 5. Harm boundary and player-facing legal

This grant does not authorize real-world harm, illegal activity, or
impersonation of Autonomicity Games Inc. staff or legal authorities.

In-game strategic entropy, if any, is not authorized by this file. Player-facing policies live only in game-tree `legal/` documents.

